#: accounts/permissions.py:149
msgid "Comptes et rôles"
msgstr "Accounts and roles"

#: accounts/permissions.py:150
msgid "Créer, modifier, activer ou désactiver un compte."
msgstr "Create, edit, activate or deactivate an account."

#: accounts/permissions.py:155
msgid "Pays et managers"
msgstr "Countries and managers"

#: accounts/permissions.py:156
msgid "Créer et modifier les pays, leurs devises et leurs managers."
msgstr "Create and edit countries, their currencies and their managers."

#: accounts/permissions.py:161
msgid "Équipes, projets, intitulés"
msgstr "Teams, projects, expense titles"

#: accounts/permissions.py:163
msgid "Gérer le référentiel des pays : équipes, projets, intitulés, catégories, bénéficiaires. Le manager y déclare, la RH le tient."
msgstr "Maintain the countries' reference data: teams, projects, expense titles, categories, beneficiaries. Managers declare within it, HR maintains it."

#: accounts/permissions.py:170
msgid "Enveloppes et réallocations"
msgstr "Budgets and reallocations"

#: accounts/permissions.py:172
msgid "Attribuer les budgets, arbitrer les transferts, tenir les taux de change : super administrateurs."
msgstr "Allocate budgets, decide on transfers, maintain exchange rates: super administrators."

#: accounts/permissions.py:179
msgid "Saisie et soumission"
msgstr "Entry and submission"

#: accounts/permissions.py:181
msgid "Saisir des dépenses, déposer des pièces, soumettre un dossier : le manager, pour son pays."
msgstr "Enter expenses, upload supporting documents, submit a file: the manager, for their country."

#: accounts/permissions.py:188 expenses/models.py:528
msgid "Mise en contrôle"
msgstr "Put under review"

#: accounts/permissions.py:190
msgid "Prendre un dossier soumis en contrôle : le DM prépare, le DF tranche. Le pays en est exclu."
msgstr "Take a submitted file into review: the DM prepares, the DF decides. Countries are excluded."

#: accounts/permissions.py:197 budget/models.py:254 expenses/models.py:529
msgid "Justification"
msgstr "Justification"

#: accounts/permissions.py:199
msgid "Constater qu'une pièce couvre une dépense, ou l'absence de preuve. Le DF tranche ; le pays en est exclu : il déclare, le siège constate."
msgstr "Establish that a document covers an expense, or that proof is missing. The DF decides; countries are excluded: they declare, headquarters establishes."

#: accounts/permissions.py:206 expenses/models.py:570 expenses/models.py:571
msgid "Journal d'audit"
msgstr "Audit log"

#: accounts/permissions.py:208
msgid "Consulter la trace des actions sensibles : RH et direction."
msgstr "Review the trail of sensitive actions: HR and management."

#: accounts/permissions.py:214
msgid "Imports et exports"
msgstr "Imports and exports"

#: accounts/permissions.py:216
msgid "Importer un classeur, exporter en Excel, CSV, Word ou PDF. Le reste de l'organisation travaille dans l'application."
msgstr "Import a workbook, export to Excel, CSV, Word or PDF. The rest of the organisation works inside the application."

#: accounts/permissions.py:223
msgid "Réouverture d'un dossier"
msgstr "Reopening a file"

#: accounts/permissions.py:225
msgid "Rouvrir un dossier déclaré pour demander des comptes. Seule exception à l'irréversibilité, motivée et tracée."
msgstr "Reopen a declared file to ask for explanations. The only exception to irreversibility, justified and logged."

